(7263887, 1129984, 6519, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the gaps bother me (and so does the "duel").<br/>A shot like this needs total precision to work well.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the gaps bother me (and so does the "duel").A shot like this needs total precision to work well.', '2014-09-17 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
