(7263920, 1129786, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!   Looks like a recently DQd image that I also love.<br/> <br/>I wish I could see the main part of the image being right angles... but the cloused and the curves of the glass get my attention first... then the wheel... then the grasses.<br/> <br/>I''d rather see this in Free Study where I could give it a HUGE score!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!   Looks like a recently DQd image that I also love. I wish I could see the main part of the image being right angles... but the cloused and the curves of the glass get my attention first... then the wheel... then the grasses. I''d rather see this in Free Study where I could give it a HUGE score!', '2014-09-17 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263927, 1129988, 163430, '<td valign="top">I was going to shoot something similar, but changed my mind and did something completely different. My wall would''t be as near as beautiful as yours.</td>', 'I was going to shoot something similar, but changed my mind and did something completely different. My wall would''t be as near as beautiful as yours.', '2014-09-17 18:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
