(7263931, 1129952, 163430, '<td valign="top">A really non-standard approach on right angles. I like how they are present, very mush implied by the shape of the apple but not quite visible. I also like the lighting. I would guess it''s a single soft/large light source.<br/> <br/>How many apples did you use? :-)<br/>They tend to change colour very fast when cut.</td>', 'A really non-standard approach on right angles. I like how they are present, very mush implied by the shape of the apple but not quite visible. I also like the lighting. I would guess it''s a single soft/large light source. How many apples did you use? :-)They tend to change colour very fast when cut.', '2014-09-17 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
