(7263939, 1129870, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot. The choice to use B&amp;W, the sharpness, the depth, the reflection... except for the tilted horizon. It''s not adding to the image.<br/>The overexposed building in the back bothers me a bit, also, but just a bit and i can live with that. The more i look at it, the less it bothers me. The horizon is what''s killing this image for me. :-(</td>', 'I like everything about this shot. The choice to use B&W, the sharpness, the depth, the reflection... except for the tilted horizon. It''s not adding to the image.The overexposed building in the back bothers me a bit, also, but just a bit and i can live with that. The more i look at it, the less it bothers me. The horizon is what''s killing this image for me. :-(', '2014-09-17 19:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7263940, 1129811, 163430, '<td valign="top">What is it?<br/>Is it a projected light or a spraypaint?<br/>Please post a colour version of this in the outtakes thread. I''m intrigued.</td>', 'What is it?Is it a projected light or a spraypaint?Please post a colour version of this in the outtakes thread. I''m intrigued.', '2014-09-17 19:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
