(7263945, 1129922, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, the idea, the lighting, but i don''t like the greenish/sepia toning. I would prefer clear B&amp;W. If it were pure B&amp;W i believe that the JPEG artifacts would be less visible if not gone. Or is it high ISO noise?</td>', 'I like the concept, the idea, the lighting, but i don''t like the greenish/sepia toning. I would prefer clear B&W. If it were pure B&W i believe that the JPEG artifacts would be less visible if not gone. Or is it high ISO noise?', '2014-09-17 19:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
