(7264072, 1129950, 170281, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I was wondering if the exposure was brought down a bit whether it would make the colors pop out more, as well as accentuate the lines/angles.  Good perspective/framing.</td>', 'I like the photo, but I was wondering if the exposure was brought down a bit whether it would make the colors pop out more, as well as accentuate the lines/angles.  Good perspective/framing.', '2014-09-18 12:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264119, 1129990, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the pleasant feel and the soft overall tone.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the pleasant feel and the soft overall tone.', '2014-09-18 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264120, 1129728, 13077, '<td valign="top">Right angles? Sorta... Kinda... Sortakinda...<br/>Not a bad photo, but the out-of-focus blob on the left isn''t doing it any favors and it could use a saturation and contrast bump.</td>', 'Right angles? Sorta... Kinda... Sortakinda...Not a bad photo, but the out-of-focus blob on the left isn''t doing it any favors and it could use a saturation and contrast bump.', '2014-09-18 18:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264121, 1129890, 13077, '<td valign="top">Did you get wet shooting this one? Good use of several different surfaces, lots of right angles and leading lines without making it too busy.</td>', 'Did you get wet shooting this one? Good use of several different surfaces, lots of right angles and leading lines without making it too busy.', '2014-09-18 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264122, 1129946, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s always technically difficult to shoot a subject in shade while parts of the photo are in the sun. Given that it''s not a journalistic type of photo, I would have moved the chair.</td>', 'It''s always technically difficult to shoot a subject in shade while parts of the photo are in the sun. Given that it''s not a journalistic type of photo, I would have moved the chair.', '2014-09-18 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264123, 1129935, 13077, '<td valign="top">Bold decision to have most of the photo blank. There are some right angles but the photo isn''t very visually pleasing to me. I will check back and read your comments to see what concept you were going for though.</td>', 'Bold decision to have most of the photo blank. There are some right angles but the photo isn''t very visually pleasing to me. I will check back and read your comments to see what concept you were going for though.', '2014-09-18 19:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264124, 1129916, 13077, '<td valign="top">About as close as nature usually gets to right angles. These were challenging lighting conditions to shoot it, a cloudy day would have made it a lot more attractive, and it looks like the dynamic range of the camera you used wasn''t suited very well to this scene either.</td>', 'About as close as nature usually gets to right angles. These were challenging lighting conditions to shoot it, a cloudy day would have made it a lot more attractive, and it looks like the dynamic range of the camera you used wasn''t suited very well to this scene either.', '2014-09-18 19:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264125, 1129942, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cool setup - nicely composed and I like the look from the processing.</td>', 'Cool setup - nicely composed and I like the look from the processing.', '2014-09-18 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264126, 1129976, 13077, '<td valign="top">Great job making common objects interesting. The different ring patterns in the wood are beautiful.</td>', 'Great job making common objects interesting. The different ring patterns in the wood are beautiful.', '2014-09-18 19:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264128, 1129923, 13077, '<td valign="top">WOW there''s a lot going on in this photo, looks almost like an optical illusion. Very cool, though.</td>', 'WOW there''s a lot going on in this photo, looks almost like an optical illusion. Very cool, though.', '2014-09-18 19:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264129, 1129782, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good photo for an AARP advertisement. However, the composition feels a little unbalanced with the negative space on the left and I don''t think the rocks at the bottom are doing you any favors.</td>', 'Looks like a good photo for an AARP advertisement. However, the composition feels a little unbalanced with the negative space on the left and I don''t think the rocks at the bottom are doing you any favors.', '2014-09-18 19:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264131, 1129786, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, I sure hope you post the ''recipe'' for the processing of this one. I see some right angles and that''s good enough for me, but if you take the challenge description literally I don''t know if they add any strength to the photo. In a free study I''d give it a 9, probably still an 8 without the fascinating effect, so for this challenge it''s still a 7</td>', 'This is beautiful, I sure hope you post the ''recipe'' for the processing of this one. I see some right angles and that''s good enough for me, but if you take the challenge description literally I don''t know if they add any strength to the photo. In a free study I''d give it a 9, probably still an 8 without the fascinating effect, so for this challenge it''s still a 7', '2014-09-18 19:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264132, 1129902, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good composition and I like the detail in the steps.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good composition and I like the detail in the steps.', '2014-09-18 19:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264133, 1129958, 13077, '<td valign="top">Lots of right angles, and appropriate shadows. Wonder what it would have looked like in pure B&amp;W though.</td>', 'Lots of right angles, and appropriate shadows. Wonder what it would have looked like in pure B&W though.', '2014-09-18 19:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264134, 1129925, 13077, '<td valign="top">It looks like the lighting conditions got the best of you on this one. Hard to say if it would have been a good photo even with good light, but the noise and subsequent overt noise reduction would ruin anything.</td>', 'It looks like the lighting conditions got the best of you on this one. Hard to say if it would have been a good photo even with good light, but the noise and subsequent overt noise reduction would ruin anything.', '2014-09-18 19:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264135, 1129749, 13077, '<td valign="top">Sure is. Is that made up of frame corners? Interesting patterns and I like how the border looks like a double mat - like the frame is the subject and the mat is the frame. Good concept.</td>', 'Sure is. Is that made up of frame corners? Interesting patterns and I like how the border looks like a double mat - like the frame is the subject and the mat is the frame. Good concept.', '2014-09-18 19:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7264136, 1129991, 13077, '<td valign="top">Brrr. Good angle to illustrate how manmade things are the only right angles around.</td>', 'Brrr. Good angle to illustrate how manmade things are the only right angles around.', '2014-09-18 19:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
