(7265580, 1129930, 86447, '<td valign="top">This would really do well in a Shadows challenge!  I see that the bricks are at right angles... but only because my mind adjusts for the perspective.  <br/> <br/>To portray "right angles" really well... I think they need to appear as 90 degree angles instead of varying degrees of angles.<br/> <br/>But... I''ve been called crazy before.  *grin*<br/> <br/>If this were in a Free Study... I''d score it much higher.   It''s a FABULOUS image!</td>', 'This would really do well in a Shadows challenge!  I see that the bricks are at right angles... but only because my mind adjusts for the perspective.   To portray "right angles" really well... I think they need to appear as 90 degree angles instead of varying degrees of angles. But... I''ve been called crazy before.  *grin* If this were in a Free Study... I''d score it much higher.   It''s a FABULOUS image!', '2014-09-24 00:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
