(7265602, 1129797, 86447, '<td valign="top">I totally LOVE this image!  <br/> <br/>Your use of the space and your composition of it is ... so intriguing!<br/> <br/>Unfortunately... for this challenge... the viewers will want to see (I think) the right angles as... right angles.   <br/> <br/>I know they''re there.  You know they''re there.   The voters know they''re there, but...<br/> <br/>I can''t imagine that if anyone looked at this image and had 100 chances to give a two-word description of it... that anyone would mention "right angle".<br/> <br/>So... I fear that your score is probably suffering from that.<br/> <br/>I''d have to agree, though... it doesn''t portray "right angles" as well as if you''d shot the image from a less fun perspective.  *grin*</td>', 'I totally LOVE this image!   Your use of the space and your composition of it is ... so intriguing! Unfortunately... for this challenge... the viewers will want to see (I think) the right angles as... right angles.    I know they''re there.  You know they''re there.   The voters know they''re there, but... I can''t imagine that if anyone looked at this image and had 100 chances to give a two-word description of it... that anyone would mention "right angle". So... I fear that your score is probably suffering from that. I''d have to agree, though... it doesn''t portray "right angles" as well as if you''d shot the image from a less fun perspective.  *grin*', '2014-09-24 00:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
