(7265610, 1129870, 68503, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone, some mentioned the horizon wasnt straight but it actually is. What your seeing on the slant was the marble ledge that I was shooting from. If I straightened it, then it put everything else of skew. I thought it was unique for the challenge and it didnt place to poorly :)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone, some mentioned the horizon wasnt straight but it actually is. What your seeing on the slant was the marble ledge that I was shooting from. If I straightened it, then it put everything else of skew. I thought it was unique for the challenge and it didnt place to poorly :)', '2014-09-24 01:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
