(7265760, 1129982, 103142, '<td valign="top">That''s weird -- it''s not showing my score on this one, yet I really thought I voted on it. I''m getting scores on the rest....<br/> <br/>This is what I thought of, and my mind filled in the right angles without any problem!<br/> <br/>(Image found on web on "The Game Gal" site)<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''data:image/jpeg;base64,'', strrpos(''data:image/jpeg;base64,'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-24 10:12:20.</i></td>', 'That''s weird -- it''s not showing my score on this one, yet I really thought I voted on it. I''m getting scores on the rest.... This is what I thought of, and my mind filled in the right angles without any problem! (Image found on web on "The Game Gal" site) ', '2014-09-24 11:11:43.000000', '2014-09-24 11:12:20.000000', 0),
