(7265901, 1129692, 30364, '<td valign="top">Thank you Don ( I mean the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=153814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">nygold</a> Don).  I understood your point.  But I''d much rather alienate, disappoint or baffle a healthy proportion of viewers than I would please everybody.  I believe that the most interesting and meaningful outcomes - in photographs as in anything - derive from disagreement, and not from consensus.  Universal appeal equals artistic and intellectual death.</td>', 'Thank you Don ( I mean the  nygold Don).  I understood your point.  But I''d much rather alienate, disappoint or baffle a healthy proportion of viewers than I would please everybody.  I believe that the most interesting and meaningful outcomes - in photographs as in anything - derive from disagreement, and not from consensus.  Universal appeal equals artistic and intellectual death.', '2014-09-24 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
