(7265947, 1129692, 124815, '<td valign="top">My iPad ate or pulverized a lot my comments. <br/>I simply loved this bouquet. It made me think of its missing parts that creates a mandala. <br/> <br/>As to meeting a challenge topic: the struggle at DPC is to think of a given task and make a photographic image. No small feet. But if meeting a challenge results in a meaningless representation of a required theme - a banana, a right angle, a wooden figure, a drop of water- then this site does not meet its goal. It should be a DNMG = does not meet goal.<br/>After all, what do we do with an image that just met its topic?</td>', 'My iPad ate or pulverized a lot my comments. I simply loved this bouquet. It made me think of its missing parts that creates a mandala.  As to meeting a challenge topic: the struggle at DPC is to think of a given task and make a photographic image. No small feet. But if meeting a challenge results in a meaningless representation of a required theme - a banana, a right angle, a wooden figure, a drop of water- then this site does not meet its goal. It should be a DNMG = does not meet goal.After all, what do we do with an image that just met its topic?', '2014-09-24 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 0),
